            "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hue Hue Defense, as the name suggests, is a Brazilian Tower Defense game. In this world, the king of trolling, Hue Hue B'Erri, is directing his fleet of meme-clad &quot;undead.&quot; Reduce his fleet and stop him from reaching the city airport, or it will be a global catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage four types of towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slab Tower:</strong> A tower with long-range and two units that attack independently, with upgrades that double the attack power up to an angry pinscher. Use this tower to your advantage against slow enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aura Tower:</strong> Summon the help of the most chadd dog on the internet, capable of paralyzing one enemy at a time and causing area damage. Its upgrades vary from a life-sized Goliath to a full bladder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk Tower:</strong> The house specialty, a long-range tower with continuous attack. Among the upgrade options, we have a super coil and heat dissipators. <strong>*Without this tower, no other tower can gain upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleacher Tower:</strong> <strong>THIS IS A CANNON!</strong> Literally... a medium-range tower with slow attack speed but great area damage. Upgrade with goalposts or floodlights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Bochecha has a bazaar and a huge greed. Instead of fixed prices, here you run the risk of losing out. Be quick and decisive when negotiating with him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating an enemy, there is a chance they will drop an item. Use these to upgrade your towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are temporary. Collect gas cans dropped by enemies and use them to call for four-wheeled help. After some time, they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with clicks in various ways. Throughout the game, you will face challenges that could lead to your demise. Be quick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This game is in development and may undergo changes in the final product.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hue Hue Defense, as the name suggests, is a Brazilian Tower Defense game. In this world, the king of trolling, Hue Hue B'Erri, is directing his fleet of meme-clad &quot;undead.&quot; Reduce his fleet and stop him from reaching the city airport, or it will be a global catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage four types of towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slab Tower:</strong> A tower with long-range and two units that attack independently, with upgrades that double the attack power up to an angry pinscher. Use this tower to your advantage against slow enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aura Tower:</strong> Summon the help of the most chadd dog on the internet, capable of paralyzing one enemy at a time and causing area damage. Its upgrades vary from a life-sized Goliath to a full bladder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk Tower:</strong> The house specialty, a long-range tower with continuous attack. Among the upgrade options, we have a super coil and heat dissipators. <strong>*Without this tower, no other tower can gain upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleacher Tower:</strong> <strong>THIS IS A CANNON!</strong> Literally... a medium-range tower with slow attack speed but great area damage. Upgrade with goalposts or floodlights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Bochecha has a bazaar and a huge greed. Instead of fixed prices, here you run the risk of losing out. Be quick and decisive when negotiating with him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating an enemy, there is a chance they will drop an item. Use these to upgrade your towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are temporary. Collect gas cans dropped by enemies and use them to call for four-wheeled help. After some time, they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with clicks in various ways. Throughout the game, you will face challenges that could lead to your demise. Be quick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This game is in development and may undergo changes in the final product.</strong></p>",
            "short_description": "A mysterious villain unleashes a virus, bringing internet memes to life as a bizarre army marching toward the city's airport. Build towers, unlock powerful abilities, and defend Camaracity from a worldwide outbreak. Stop Hue Hue B'Erri, the king of trolling, before he reaches his final destination.",
